  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes since 0.9.0\n\n### Breaking Changes\n* Renamed ``AddCliRunner`` Dependency Injection extension method to ``UseCliRunner``\n* Removed deprecated static ``Cli`` class - Use ``Command.CreateInstance`` static class instead.\n* Removed destructive BufferedCommandResult to CommandResult extension method.\n* Removed ``GetInstallLocationAsync`` method from ``AbstractInstallableCommand`` as redundant - Use the Command's ``TargetFilePath`` property for the file path.\n\n### Non-Breaking Changes\n\n#### General Changes\n* Added some missing xml doc comments\n* [.NET Standard 2.0 only] Updated OSCompatibilityLib dependency from 3.0.0 to 3.0.1\n* [.NET Standard 2.0 only] Updated Polyfill dependency from 7.12.0 to 7.14.0\n* [Specializations Library only] Fixed a bug with CmdCommand that would cause the wrong file path to be used.",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
